{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/AboutSnailMail.png?t=1747748751\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Snail Mail is a competitive 2 or 4-player online card-based board game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/GameplayNew.gif?t=1747748751\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a snail and bring your snailtopian town to glory by delivering THE letter to the other end FIRST.  <br>  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/FriendsWithBenefits.png?t=1747748751\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Call upon otherworldly allies by playing thematic, powerful cards that change the course of the game </strong><br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/CardCapture.gif?t=1747748751\" />You are not alone in this race! Your friends from other realities are ready to help you advance faster on the board or stall the enemy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/CuratedChaos.png?t=1747748751\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is no slow crawl! You need a whole lot of strategy and a <i>little </i>bit of luck to win this chaotic game. Be on your toes as you navigate through the board because one big brain move can change the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/CuratedChaosGif.gif?t=1747748751\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/ImmenseReplayability.png?t=1747748751\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/MultipleMaps.gif?t=1747748751\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No two games are the same! At the start of each match, you and your opponents choose from a variety of unique card packs\u2014mix and match to create powerful combos or pick the perfect pack to counter your opponents!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategic 2 or 4 player online competitive card-based board game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose different thematic card packs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play cards to advance your snail or stall the opponent</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose different map themes to set a different vibe</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3669550?t=1747748751","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/0ee4b38e4d5db3ca78cf80741f94cfd96442c7de/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747748751","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/b83fa8f2ce9972a4918372d6bd06a8e70ec054fc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747748751","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/b83fa8f2ce9972a4918372d6bd06a8e70ec054fc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747748751","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/AboutSnailMail.png?t=1747748751\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Snail Mail is a competitive 2 or 4-player online card-based board game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/GameplayNew.gif?t=1747748751\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a snail and bring your snailtopian town to glory by delivering THE letter to the other end FIRST.  <br>  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/FriendsWithBenefits.png?t=1747748751\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Call upon otherworldly allies by playing thematic, powerful cards that change the course of the game </strong><br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/CardCapture.gif?t=1747748751\" />You are not alone in this race! Your friends from other realities are ready to help you advance faster on the board or stall the enemy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/CuratedChaos.png?t=1747748751\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is no slow crawl! You need a whole lot of strategy and a <i>little </i>bit of luck to win this chaotic game. Be on your toes as you navigate through the board because one big brain move can change the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/CuratedChaosGif.gif?t=1747748751\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/ImmenseReplayability.png?t=1747748751\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/MultipleMaps.gif?t=1747748751\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No two games are the same! At the start of each match, you and your opponents choose from a variety of unique card packs\u2014mix and match to create powerful combos or pick the perfect pack to counter your opponents!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategic 2 or 4 player online competitive card-based board game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose different thematic card packs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play cards to advance your snail or stall the opponent</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose different map themes to set a different vibe</p></li></ul>","developers":["WASD Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/730723a0b094bc805e0743ebd8911965c0dce069/header.jpg?t=1747748751","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257142179,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257142179/movie480.mp4?t=1747748746","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257142179/movie_max.mp4?t=1747748746"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257142179/a01615edb9453f0b7b4ebab5b3df5323c345faab/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747748746","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257142179/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1747748746","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257142179/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1747748746"}}],"name":"Snail Mail","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel\u00ae UHD Graphics (Core i3)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadba